{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07636","headline":"行行且游猎篇 · 孟云卿","name":"行行且游猎篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"少年多武力，勇气冠幽州。\n何以纵心赏，马啼春草头。\n迟迟平原上，狐兔奔林丘。\n猛虎忽前逝，俊鹰连下韝。\n俯身逐南北，轻捷固难俦。\n所发无不中，失之如我讐。\n岂唯务驰骋，猗尔暴田畴。\n残杀非不痛，古来良有由。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟云卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07636.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07636","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}